# Optional ignore for fetch failures log inside the upstream mirror
public/upstream/fetch-failures.log

# NOTE: public/upstream/ IS committed (~500 MB of commentary, images, papers).
# This makes the GitHub Pages deploy fully self-contained — visitors get
# everything from your Pages domain with zero dependency on third-party
# hosting. If you don't want that, gitignore the whole `public/upstream/`
# directory and the app will fall back to upstream CDNs at runtime.
